Package: PICsnATAC
Title: Paired Insertion Counting for Single-Nucleus ATAC-Seq Data
Version: 0.3.2
Authors@R: c(
           person("Zhen", "Miao", , "zhenmiao@pennmedicine.upenn.edu",
             role = c("aut", "cre"),
             comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3255-9517")
             ),
           person("Junhyong", "Kim",, role = c("aut"), 
             comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7726-8246")
             ))
Description: Implements Paired Insertion Counting (PIC) for consistent
    quantification of single-nucleus assay for transposase-accessible chromatin
    sequencing data. It also provides model-based insertion-rate estimation and
    likelihood-ratio testing for differential accessibility, as described in
    Miao and Kim (2024) <doi:10.1038/s41592-023-02103-7>.
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.1.0)
